{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "6ff43a53-2136-8a73-ae35-a4141953b4f6",
  "created_at": "2026-01-05T10:56:51-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Ana Amaral",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tony Ferreira",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T10:54:00-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Tony. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T10:54:04-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Tony. Ana Amaral. I'm at 390 Rhode Island Avenue, up the Hill. I've got my water and sewer bill here and honestly it's a lump number. I can't tell what I used when."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T10:54:17-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can pull that up. So the bill shows one total for the billing period, right? Not a month-by-month picture."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T10:54:25-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. Just one total. I'm trying to put together a budget for the year and I want a breakdown of usage by month. Can you give me that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T10:54:36-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can read you what's on the account. Meter readings get posted per billing cycle, so I'll give you each bill's usage and the dates it covers. It won't be exactly calendar months, but it'll show you the pattern."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T10:54:50-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That works. Actually, can you just send it to me? And a duplicate of this bill too, by email."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T10:54:57-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, I can email a duplicate copy and the usage history together. Do you have the email on file still, or do you want a different one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T10:55:07-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The one on file is fine. It's the same one I've had forever."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T10:55:12-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'll send it over this morning. You should have it in a little while. Check spam if it doesn't show up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T10:55:20-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. Another thing. Next, the bill's due soon and I'm not going to be near City Hall. Can I pay on the website with a card right now, like late in the day? Or is that only during office hours?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T10:55:35-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The website payment page is open around the clock, so you can pay at night or on a weekend. The payment posts when you submit it, though it may show on the account the next business day. There's also a drop box at City Hall for checks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T10:55:52-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So no need to wait until you open. Does the website charge extra for a card?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T10:55:59-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Card payments online usually carry a processing fee, yes. The page shows it before you confirm, so you'll see it up front. A check or the drop box avoids that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T10:56:10-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course there's a fee. Everything's got a fee. I'm already looking at whether a warehouse club membership is worth it, and that's a fee too. Everybody wants a piece."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T10:56:21-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. Well, the check route keeps it simple if you want to dodge the fee."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T10:56:28-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, I'll probably just do the check. Fine. So you've got my email and the usage by month, and a copy of the bill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T10:56:37-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. Duplicate bill plus the usage history for 390 Rhode Island Avenue, going to the email on file. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T10:56:45-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. Thanks, Tony."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T10:56:48-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Ana. Have a good Monday."
    }
  ],
